# Scenario "basement-movie" (PAL, milestones 6 and 9, issue 34): the silent THP movie of the basement (stage 3),
# reached from a new game. The movie is played by the event of the socket on the big robot of the basement, the first
# time Chibi-Robo plugs into it (story flag not set yet in a new game). tools/run.py --stage basement loads the save
# into stage 3 (game.toml, [stage]): Chibi-Robo starts at the top of the stairs. The route goes down the stairs,
# across the floor (a short cutscene without dialogue on the way), to the socket; A takes the plug in hand, A plugs
# in, then A every 25 frames goes through the dialogue of the event. No A during the movie (46 s, 1150 frames at
# 25 fps); the event goes on after it. The game runs at 25 frames per second in PAL: frame numbers and stick
# durations differ from the US scenario, and the path after the cutscene is split differently (camera).
# Run it with the user folder left by the "new-game" scenario (save in slot 1):
#   py -3 tools/run.py chibi-robo --version GGTP01 --stage basement --user-seed <new-game folder>/user \
#     --scenario games/chibi-robo/scenarios/play/GGTP01/basement-movie.scn
# Checkpoints: every 2 frames at the start of the movie, every frame at its end, every 25 frames in between, 30
# consecutive frames in the middle (each frame of the movie is shown).
# Not run by tools/ab.py (progression scenario). No game data here: buttons, frame numbers and names only.
# Recorded on GGTP01 (cycle clock, RTC 800000000). US version: play/GGTE01/basement-movie.scn.
name basement-movie
description New-game save loaded into the basement (--stage basement): walk to the socket of the big robot, plug in, the basement THP movie (PAL).
version GGTP01
after new-game     # preparation: user folder (save) left by "new-game"
window 0
input   150 A 10       # 60/50 Hz prompt: confirm the 50 Hz option
input  1050 A 10       # health and safety warning
input  2600 A 10       # title screen: Load Game
input  2850 LEFT 5       # file selection: from file 1 to file 3 (the cursor wraps around)
input  2900 RIGHT 5       # ... and back to file 1
input  2950 A 10       # load file 1
input  3150 SLEFT 80       # top of the stairs: down the first steps
input  3230 SDOWN 340       # off the side of the stairs, then across the floor (a cutscene starts on the way)
input  3950 SDOWN+SRIGHT 67       # after the cutscene: towards the wall
input  4025 SLEFT 15       # turn along the big robot
input  4040 SUP+SLEFT 25       # along the big robot
input  4075 SUP+SRIGHT 42       # next to the socket
input  4125 A       # take the plug in hand
input  4267 A       # plug into the socket: the event starts
# A every 25 frames from 4825 to 5650: dialogue of the event (each line waits for A)
input  4825 A
input  4850 A
input  4875 A
input  4900 A
input  4925 A
input  4950 A
input  4975 A
input  5000 A
input  5025 A
input  5050 A
input  5075 A
input  5100 A
input  5125 A
input  5150 A
input  5175 A
input  5200 A
input  5225 A
input  5250 A
input  5275 A
input  5300 A
input  5325 A
input  5350 A
input  5375 A
input  5400 A
input  5425 A
input  5450 A
input  5475 A
input  5500 A
input  5525 A
input  5550 A
input  5575 A
input  5600 A
input  5625 A
input  5650 A
